<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech unit gets 300 mln ATS China order.</title>
<headline>VA Tech unit gets 300 mln ATS China order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>VA Tech subsidiary Voest-Alpine Industrieanlagenbau (VAI) said on Thursday it and Germany's Fuchs Systemtechnik had landed an order worth 300 million schillings for a steelmaking plant in China.</p>
<p>The contract, from Guangzhou Zhujiang Co Ltd, is for a conventional electric arc furnace which is scheduled to begin operation in 1998. Annual capacity will be one million tonnes of liquid steel, which is then processed into hot rolled coils.</p>
<p>VAI, a metallurgical plant builder and systems supplier for individual and integrated plants, owns 44 percent of Fuchs Systemtechnik. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 254</p>
</text>
